<title>UK: Telkom at $28.625 in London at 0859 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $28.625 in London at 0859 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $28.625 and London at 0859 GMT on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of $28.5 and the day's high of $28.8125.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday $29.3125. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
